\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b\f0\fs36\lang9 Dragon Quest XI S Cutscenes - Character Side Stories\par
\b0\fs22 1. Sylvando\line 2. Jade\line 3. Rab\line 4. Erik\line 5. Hendrik\par
\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl\cf1\f1\lang1033 Queen Marina\cell Mordegon has played his hand\emdash the game is all but won. A shroud of deepest darkness has eclipsed the shining sun.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell And yet, amid the shadows glimmer tiny specks of light. Faint, flick'ring flames that rage against the coming of the night.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell How can such sparks of hope remain, when darkness rules the land? Now evil reigns supreme, who has the strength to take a stand?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell His friends still live, his friends still fight, their cause is not forlorn. The night is dark and dreadful, but we may yet see the dawn.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell Though Erdrea is racked with darkness, suffering and pain, the Luminary's light can shine upon this land again!\cell\row 
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\par
\b\f0\fs24 1. Sylvando\b0\par
\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl\f1\fs22\cell Wh-What happened...?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl\cell Where... Where am I...?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell I'm alive...? But...how...?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Dave\cell Sylv! Syyylv! Fank goodness yer alright!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ah, there you are. You alright, Sylv?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Oh, sure Dave, honey, I, I was just...getting a little air. Being cooped up in that cabin was driving me crazy, you know?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Dave\cell Ahh, come on, Sylv! Cheer up, will ya? I don't fink I can take much more o' this mopin'!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell That day...when Mordegon... There was nothing I could do... He was just too powerful... I thought it was the end for me... For all of us...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell But this... This is worse than death... To wake up and find everybody gone, and the world consumed by darkness...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell (sigh)\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell I'm sorry, Dave, but I just... I can't do this...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell I know I should feel lucky to be alive, but without the others... I'm nothing... Nobody...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Dave\cell Right. That's enuff o' that.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Dave\cell 'Ave you lost yer bleedin' marbles!? Since when were them mates o' yours the types to let some Lord o' Shadows numpty get the better of 'em, eh!?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Dave\cell 'Ow about you 'ave a bit o' bleedin' faith in 'em like you used to? Or did you fink savin' the world was gonna be easy or somefink!?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Oh, Dave... Darling... You're right.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell If a slip of a thing like me was able to get out of that tangle with Mordegon alive, then the others must have done, too!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell And here I am feeling sorry for myself instead of getting out there and trying to find them! What would Veronica and Erik say if they saw me like this!?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Dave\cell That's more bleedin' like it! It's good to 'ave you back, me old mucker!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Oh, it's good to be back, believe me! Now, enough chit-chat\emdash it's time for action! We need to make land at the nearest port and find out just how much of a mess the world is in.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell And once we've done that, we can make a start on fixing it!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Dave\cell Sounds like a plan, Sylv! Nearest 'arbour to 'ere would be over in Gondolia. I'll plot a course right away!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell That sounds just perfect, honey!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Anchors aweigh! Hoist the mainsail! Gondolia, here we come!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Dave\cell Heh heh heh! Aye aye, captain!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Bad day, hm? Don't worry, honey. It happens to us all.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh. You're one of those minstrel types, are you? Look, if it's money you want, you'd better go and hassle someone else. I haven't got a penny to give you.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Sorry, darling. No can do. It's against my policy to leave people all alone when they look as down in the dumps as you do.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl\cell *: (sigh)\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Look, why don't you just tell me what's on your mind? A problem shared is a problem halved!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell That's better! Now we can talk properly. Sylvando, entertainer extraordinaire, at your service!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1452\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Right, well... My name's Tetsu. I'm a blacksmith from Hotto, though I haven't been back in a long old while. I'll tell you my story if you really want, but I'm warning you, it doesn't have a happy ending...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Tetsu\cell After all those years away, I thought it was time for me to finally head home, see how my mother was doing, you know. But then the minute I set out on my journey, Yggdrasil fell.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Tetsu\cell That just made me even more desperate to get back, of course. I was so worried about her... I managed to make it as far as Gondolia, but then my luck finally ran out.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Tetsu\cell My luggage was stolen by a gang of thieves who've been terrorising the town. The Beastly Boys, they call themselves.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Tetsu\cell I can't make the journey to Hotto without all my things. Especially not the lilies of the valley I brought for my mother...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Tetsu\cell They're her favourite flower. I wanted to give them to her to say... Well, to say sorry for being away for so long. For leaving her all alone...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Oh, honey! Believe me, I know exactly how you feel!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Fear not, friend! Your mother will get her flowers! Dave and I will make sure of that! All you need to do is tell us where we can find these Beastly Boys!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1452\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Tetsu\cell Oh, well...if you're sure. There are two merchants\emdash brothers\emdash who run establishments in the southern part of town. I've heard that the Beastly Boys have been hanging around causing trouble at the older one's stall.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell A stall in the south of town, eh? Alright! We'll be back before you know it! Dave, darling\emdash let's roll!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1452\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Tetsu\cell W-Wait! Look, I appreciate you trying to help me, but these are real thugs we're talking about here. And...no offence, but you're just an entertainer, right? I wouldn't want you getting hurt...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Oh, don't you worry about me, sweetie! I'm more than just a pretty face, you know!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Now, if you don't mind...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl\cell Sylvando grabs Tetsu's knapsack!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Dave\cell Wot we gonna do wiv this 'orrible lot then, Sylv?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Well, beastly they may be, but they're not exactly the dangerous thugs we heard about. They can barely swing a sword. What's your story, boys, eh?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We didn't start out as criminals. We were fishermen. And very happy fishermen, at that.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But after Yggdrasil fell, we couldn't take the boats out any more. Have you seen the sea lately? It's swarming with monsters!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Things were just impossible... Most days, we barely had anything to eat...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The world might as well have ended that day. We lost our families... Lost everything... And no one came to help us...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl\cell *: So we had to choose between a life of crime or starving to death\emdash and that's no choice at all!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Watch closely, darlings. This is just an ordinary steel pike, yes? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Think again!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell From arms to mmms! Who's for fresh bread, huh?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Bon app\f0\'e9tit, Beastly Boys! Eat your fill, and forget your wicked ways! You'll be beaming again before you know it!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Wait!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Who... Who are you...?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Me? Oh, nobody. Just someone who likes to see people smile.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Tetsu\cell Oh, thank goodness! They're still in one piece!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Tetsu\cell Now I can go home to my mother with my head held high! Thank you, Mister Sylvando. Oh. Here\f1\emdash\f0 it's not much, but I want you to have these...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Oh, Tetsu, darling! Whatever they are, I'm sure they're wonderful! You're such a sweetie!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Tetsu\cell Honestly, you deserve much more. Come and visit me in Hotto sometime. I'll be able to thank you properly.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Tetsu\cell Now, I'd better be off. I'd tell you to be careful, but I've got a feeling you'll be just fine. Bye for now!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Dave\cell 'Ere, you alright, Sylv?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Oh, I'm better than alright, darling! I've found it! My purpose in life! My raison d'\'eatre!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell You know how I've been so down in the dumps thinking about all the despair and suffering in the world?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Well, if that's what's making me so unhappy, there's only one thing to do about it\f1\emdash\f0 get out there and fix the problem! Help make people happy again!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Just because I can't save the world with some grand, heroic gesture, that doesn't mean I can't do it one smile at a time!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Dave\cell That's my Sylv! I'm wiv you all the way!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We heard everything you just said!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Dave\cell It's them tea leafs from before! I 'ope they ain't spoilin' for another fight. Didn't they learn their lesson first time 'round?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You have to let us come with you! You have to let us help people! We're done with our life of crime thanks to you!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell You want to tag along? Hmm... Well, I hope you understand it won't be easy. I can't guarantee you'll get home in one piece...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We don't care!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Well, in that case, welcome aboard, darlings!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl\cell Three new friends join Sylvando's merry band!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Now, as luck would have it, I've got you all a welcome gift! Here\f1\emdash\f0 take one each now, don't be greedy!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Oh, they're simply fabulous! Darlings, you look splendid!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1386\cellx10362 
